  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1510.02 Applicability. This part shall apply to all projects for which an AOT permit is required that will involve blasting of bedrock.\n\nSource. #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
